flowchart TD
    A[Alert fired] --> B{Is activity expected?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Validate approved activity]
    B -->|No| D{Is source trusted?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Validate service account]
    D -->|No| F{Matches known baseline?}
    F -->|Yes| G[Possible benign positive]
    F -->|No| H{Supporting malicious evidence?}
    H -->|Yes| I[Escalate]
    H -->|No| J[Gather more telemetry]
    I --> K{Malicious intent confirmed?}
    J --> K
    K -->|Yes| L[Incident]
    K -->|No| M[Monitor or close with evidence]
